@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = paste-parent-access-token
@student = 1
@main = 1
@savings = 2
@card = 1

### Raise a dispute — body = the transaction row's "dispute_target" + reason
POST {{base}}/disputes/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pos_transaction": 1, "reason_category": "wrong_amount", "description": "Only bought one chapati" }

### Track my disputes
GET {{base}}/disputes/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/disputes/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
